Task

| Field        | Type          | Desciption             | Constraints                                | 
| ------------ | --------------| ---------------------- |--------------------------------------------|
| id           | int           | ID  PRIMARY KEY        |PK                                          |
| title        | VARCHAR(100)  | title                  |NOT NULL                                    |
| description  | VARCHAR(1000) | description            |NULL                                        |
| priority     | enum          | LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH        |NOT NULL DEFAULT LOW                        |
| status       | enum          | TODO/IN_PROGRESS/DONE  |NOT NULL DEFAULT TODO                       |
| due_date     | DATE          | due date               |NULL                                        |
| completed_at | TIMESTAMP     | date completed         |NULL                                        |
| created_at   | TIMESTAMP     | creation date          |NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP          |
| updated_at   | TIMESTAM      | update date            |NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP          |
| project_id   | int           | project ID             |NOT NULL FK -> project.id ON DELETE CASCADE |

Project

| Field       | Type          | Desciption      | Constraints                       | 
| ----------- | ------------- | --------------- |-----------------------------------|
| id          | int           | ID PRIMARY KEY  |PK                                 |
| name        | VARCHAR(100)  | project name    |NOT NULL                           |
| description | VARCHAR(1000) | description     |NULL                               |
| created_at  | TIMESTAMP     | creation date   |NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP |
| updated_at  | TIMESTAMP     | update date     |NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP |

Logic for:
-completed_at:
    status = TODO → completed_at = NULL
    status = IN_PROGRESS → completed_at = NULL
    status = DONE → completed_at = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
    DONE → IN_PROGRESS/TODO → completed_at = NULL
    again → DONE → set new current datetime datetime
created_at / updated_at:
    created by PostgreSQL

Relation:

Project 1 ─────────── N Task
                      │
                      └── project_id

When user delete project all task also will be delete.
Project DELETE
      ↓
ON DELETE CASCADE
      ↓
Task DELETEE


TRIGGER
├── updated_at
└── completed_at
